 828:Src/input/adc_btns/adc_manager.cpp **** 
 829:Src/input/adc_btns/adc_manager.cpp ****     ADCValuesMapping removedMapping = store.mapping[targetIdx];
 830:Src/input/adc_btns/adc_manager.cpp **** 
